title: 'sp-arithmetic: add checked functions and extend fuzzer coverage'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    **BREAKING**: `FixedPointNumber` trait methods `checked_from_rational`, `checked_mul_int`,
    and `checked_div_int` now return `Result<T, ArithmeticError>` instead of `Option<T>`.
    Callers using `.ok_or()`, `.and_then()`, or pattern matching on `Some`/`None` must be
    updated. `.unwrap()` and `.unwrap_or_default()` continue to work without changes.

    Changes to `sp-arithmetic`:
    - `helpers_128bit.rs`: Added `checked_multiply_by_rational_with_rounding` with proper
      `ArithmeticError` return type.
    - `per_things.rs`: Added `checked_*` versions of `square`, `mul_floor`, `mul_ceil`,
      `overflow_prune_mul`, `rational_mul_correction`, `saturating_reciprocal_mul`,
      `saturating_reciprocal_mul_floor`, `saturating_reciprocal_mul_ceil`, and
      `from_rational_with_rounding` to the `PerThing` trait. Added `checked_int_div` and
      `checked_div_with_rounding`. Fixed `checked_rational_mul_correction` error semantics.
    - `fixed_point.rs`: Added `try_into_perbill` and checked `from_rational_with_rounding`.
      Migrated `checked_from_rational`, `checked_mul_int`, `checked_div_int` from
      `Option<T>` to `Result<T, ArithmeticError>` with `DivisionByZero`/`Overflow`/`Underflow`.
    - `traits.rs`: Simplified `EnsureFixedPointNumber` wrappers (`ensure_from_rational`,
      `ensure_mul_int`, `ensure_div_int`) to directly delegate to the now-Result-returning
      checked methods.
    - `rational.rs`: Added `checked_to_den` and `checked_lcm`. Updated `checked_add` and
      `checked_sub` to use `ArithmeticError`.

    Changes to downstream callers:
    - `pallet-nomination-pools`: Updated `.ok_or()` to `.map_err()` and `.and_then()` chain
      adapted for `Result` return type.

    Fuzzer coverage:
    - 8 new fuzzer modules covering checked arithmetic, rounding, conversions, and utility
      functions across `PerThing` and `FixedPointNumber` types, using BigInt/BigUint oracles
      for value verification.
crates:
- name: sp-arithmetic
  bump: major
- name: pallet-nomination-pools
  bump: patch
